# The thesis folder holds ~11 GB of model weights, generated audio and a
# nested upstream checkout.  Only the written deliverables, the experiment
# code, the derived masks and the metric JSONs travel with git; anything
# else is regenerated by the scripts or downloaded on demand.

# Nested upstream ACE-Step-1.5 checkout: own repository, 9.4 GB of
# checkpoints plus its virtualenv.  Never part of this one.
ACE-Step-1.5/

# Downloadable evaluation models (~6.5 GB) and the archived style baselines.
experiments/eval_models/
experiments/style_baseline/

# Generated audio: per-arm outputs, separated stems, listening pools and
# the corrected-cover archive.  All of it is reproducible from the scripts.
experiments/**/outputs/*
# ...except the aggregate metric JSONs the documents cite by path.  They are
# a few dozen kilobytes and are the only on-disk source for the tables.
!experiments/**/outputs/*.json
experiments/**/listening/
experiments/**/listening_mp3/
experiments/**/stems/
experiments/cover_test_kit/sources/
experiments/cover_test_kit/04_corrected_covers/

# Raw audio never belongs in this repository; the derived masks and metric
# JSONs that the documents cite are small and are kept.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac

# 256 MB archive of the test kit that is already checked in loose; also
# above GitHub's 100 MB per-file push limit.
cover_test_kit_*.tar.gz

__pycache__/
.DS_Store
